      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "VRChat has expressed a desire to treat the text chat \"like voice\", so I think showing messages on the screen regardless of direction is a good idea. I suspect that a history works against their goals.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
