  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2025-01-26T00:55:17.860Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Currently, with text chat, you need to face the user to read the chat.\n\nIf multiple users are using text chat, you have to face that user every time someone posts.\n\nTo improve this, we propose the following:\n\nDisplay the name and chat content like a log in the bottom right of the text chat and send it to other users.\n\nThis will allow you to read the chat smoothly, like a voice conversation.\n\nIt will also function like a history, as text will no longer be overwritten.\n\nThis improvement will also expand the possibilities, such as being able to send chat only to specific users.",
